IfNull (Sum(Case When T9.FecDia = 31 Then (T1.HorMin) End), 0) As
Minutos_31
  From NomHord T1
Left Outer Join NomEmp T2 On (T1.EmpCve = T2.EmpCve)
           Join SegFec T9 On (T1.HorFec = T9.FecYmd)
Group By T1.EmpCve, T2.EmpNom, T2.EmpApe
